  }
}]]></Value>
    </blockList>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[Accidents can and do happen, and they can be expensive. Whether it's a new pair of glasses, or a court case for damages where every member of your club is liable for thousands, make sure you and your members are protected.]]></Value>
    </description>
